      "content": "yeah i feel it. but \"rest\" feels like such a temporary thing. it's like i'm just pausing for a second before i have to get back up and do all this bullshit again tomorrow. it's just constant. even when i'm sleeping, i feel like i'm just waiting for the next thing to break or the next day to start. it feels so pointless to keep trying when nothing actually changes.",
